      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/07-carp-like-fishes-1-loaches/homaloptera-tweediei/",
      "html": "<p>The adult size of the gecko-loach, Homaloptera tweediei, is only approx. 4 cm. Available size: 3-4 cm. Origin: Thailand.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "notes",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/07-carp-like-fishes-1-loaches/homaloptera-tweediei/",
      "html": "<p>This species is very interesting for hobbyists, because it can be kept for a longer period at water temperatures of more than 24°C. The main reason is its origin in central Thailand. After acclimatisation they are very thankful and easy to keep, even in a community tank. Interesting to know: they are highly reproductive; in the wild the number of fish can double in less than 15 months.</p>"
    }
